  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.relics_attr1": "Side entry:",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.bug_food": "§cIt's said that general Lei had a special cuisine. It's said that general Lei entertained other people to taste it. As a result, people went in standing and came out carrying it.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.bug_food1": "§cThere is a saying that the seven gods came by themselves and immediately disappeared. When the demon gods came by themselves, they only came to the end of being terrified. A drop of it fell to the ground and only left the surrounding grass barren for hundreds of miles and thousands of years.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.good_food": "§bBest partner(ovo)",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.relics_box1": "Can open 4-5 star holy relics",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.relics_box2": "Can open 3-4 star holy relics",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.relics_box3": "Can open 1-3 star holy relics",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.relics_exp_max": "The maximum level has been reached. Cannot continue to strengthen",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.relics_exp_big0": "Relic experience material, containing 10000 experience points.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.relics_exp_big1": "Holy relics are in essence the crystallization of will and memory, and the essence material purified from a certain pure power can make the memory and will more clear and powerful.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.relics_exp_small0": "Relic experience material, containing 1000 experience points.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.relics_exp_small1": "Essence material containing powerful energy can make holy relics grow.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.juedoushi_head": "The helmet of the legendary gladiator in ancient times was stained with the blood of countless enemies and proudly accepted the cheers of countless audiences.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.juedoushi_cup": "Ancient gladiators drank the golden cup of victory. Until the moment he fell, the glass was filled with his own years.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.juedoushi_clock": "An hour meter recording the years of the Gladiator's bloody theater. To him, it symbolizes the way to the day of freedom.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.juedoushi_feather": "A free dream feather like a falcon. At the end of his legendary career, uninhibited birds covered his heart with this feather.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.juedoushi_flower": "No one knows why the legendary fighter always wears this flower on his chest. This is the only weakness of the cruel soldier.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.yuetuan_head": "Although weather beaten, it is still a shining hat. It seems to echo the ancient melodious music.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.yuetuan_cup": "An ancient kettle with a wonderful shape is equipped with strings inside. It plays a wonderful melody without melody with the running water.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.yuetuan_clock": "The hourglass, which timed the orchestra's performance, once made a neat sound. Now their performance has come to an end.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.yuetuan_feather": "The blue arrow feathers have not faded and broken in the long years. It seems to bring the sound of falling pearls and flowing water.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.yuetuan_flower": "A small flower shaped badge. Listen to the words, as if you can hear the melodious sound of the flute and the fresh singing sound.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.jiaoguan_head": "The standard instructor hat is a special honor for officers who refuse to be promoted.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.jiaoguan_cup": "Although in the eyes of outsiders, it is just an ordinary tea cup, but in the eyes of students, it is a symbol of instructor power.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.jiaoguan_clock": "A pocket watch that can't be used to look at time is a timing tool that is completely dedicated to training.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.jiaoguan_feather": "An instructor who knows how to defuse the attack will not let this feather be blown away by the strong wind.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.jiaoguan_flower": "When an instructor wears this flower on his chest, it means that he will not practice today.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.liufangzhe_head": "The noble crown and the badge of identity were cut by a knife. The original noble identity has been dethroned.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.liufangzhe_cup": "This is a cup-shaped vessel made of dim heavy metal. It can be seen that the outer wall was originally inlaid with precious stones, but it was dug out.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.liufangzhe_clock": "The watch mirror made of crystal has been broken, even the watch pins have all fallen off, but they still don't want to throw it away.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.liufangzhe_feather": "It is not a deliberate ornament, but an unknown bird feather accidentally touched in the wilderness.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.liufangzhe_flower": "The dim flowers on my body. It must be of great significance to carry the exile body.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.yongshi_head": "A rough woven grass ring. For some people, it is as valuable as the golden crown of a king.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.yongshi_cup": "A rough stone container filled with memories.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.yongshi_clock": "The old miniature hourglass is not practical. As elusive as time.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.yongshi_feather": "Bright songbird feathers. Can bring a little courage.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.yongshi_flower": "The simple flowers pinned on the chest are souvenirs obtained after an adventure.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.xingyuner_head": "Originally, it fell into the cave, but it was the cellar of the treasures of the expelled old clan. It's a souvenir of that experience.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.xingyuner_cup": "This is an exquisite metal vessel. It was once used to defeat burglars.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.xingyuner_clock": "An hourglass empty of holes. The passage of time makes no sense to the carefree.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.xingyuner_feather": "The demon in front of him is stared at by the Falcon and falcon. Occasionally, he can bring such luck.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.xingyuner_flower": "The four leaf green flowers that grow carefree in the fields are picked because they can bring luck.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.youyi_head": "It can be used to tie the disordered hair when practicing medicine at ordinary times, and can also be used to hold up the twisted and broken arm in an emergency.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.youyi_cup": "Originally, it was filled with extremely thick refined medicine juice, but now only strong medicine flavor is left.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.youyi_clock": "A prop used for accurate timing. For a doctor, even one second can not be wasted.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.youyi_feather": "The hard feather of an owl inspires itself with the image of a night bird of prey when practicing medicine at night.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.youyi_flower": "It is a precious medicinal material, but it has lost its medicinal value after being stored for so long.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.maoxianjia_head": "The lace tied to the forehead was full of sweat and covered with dust. But dirt can hardly hide the pride of adventurers.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.maoxianjia_cup": "The booty of an adventurer's expedition, although there is a gap, is still a proud hunt.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.maoxianjia_clock": "Adventurers who often linger in the sunless abyss or the lost ancient capital often forget the time.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.maoxianjia_feather": "The feathers of exotic and wonderful birds are very rare on this continent.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.maoxianjia_flower": "The flowers found from the profound ancient capital are worn on the chest as proud medals.",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.seven_god": "Seven Heavenly Gods Statue",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.yuanshi": "Shiny stone",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.jiejing": "Material containing the power of creation",
  "paimeng.text.itemInfo.god_eye": "According to legend, when a wish is too strong, the gods will cast their gaze upon it, and the \"Eye of the God\" will appear",
  "paimeng.text.hypostasis.altar_fail": "Incomplete altar: needs the 8 different mineral blocks in a 2x2x2 cube",
  "paimeng.text.hypostasis.altar_success": "The Hypostasis awakens",
  "paimeng.text.god_eye.slot": "Equip in relic slot 6",
  "paimeng.text.god_eye.wind.desc": "Movement speed +1 (+0.1 attribute), attack speed +1, immune to slowness",
  "paimeng.text.god_eye.stone.desc": "+10 max health, +20 armor",
  "paimeng.text.god_eye.thunder.desc": "Immune to harmful potion effects and magic damage from common mobs",
  "paimeng.text.god_eye.fire.desc": "Immune to fire and lava, attacks set targets on fire",
  "paimeng.text.god_eye.ice.desc": "Immune to freezing and powder snow, attacks slow targets",
  "paimeng.text.god_eye.water.desc": "Swim speed +1, water breathing 1",
  "paimeng.text.god_eye.grass.desc": "Constant health regeneration 2, immune to poison",

